# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Fetched sources are reproducible from scripts/ingest_sources.py and are large.
# The .source.json audit sidecars ARE tracked: they are the provenance record.
data/footprints/*.raw.json
data/pluto/*.raw.json
data/streets/*.raw.json
data/boundaries/*.raw.json
data/streetscape/*.raw.json
data/horizon/*.raw.json
data/terrain/*.raw.json
data/photos/*.raw.json
# NOT ignored, deliberately: data/photos/review-decisions.json and data/photos/rejected.json.
# Those are human judgement, the one thing here that cannot be re-fetched. The raw candidate list
# can be rebuilt from a search in minutes; an afternoon spent deciding which 62 of 336 photographs
# are usable cannot.
# Cached thumbnails, fetched only to measure colours from. Third-party images are never committed:
# the corpus references them by URL and records their licence, it does not vendor them.
data/photos/cache/
# 92 MB Rhino .3dm, kept out of the tree: no standard-library parser can read it, so it is a dead
# end retained only in the M4.1 notes.
data/roofs/
data/ingest.log

# Another module's published artifacts, copied here only to co-serve them during development.
# They are NOT ours: committing them would put bridge geometry in this repository, which the
# standing obligation in MILESTONES.md forbids. Re-fetch them from the owning module instead.
viewer/public/modules/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local subpath rehearsal of the Pages build.
_pagestest/
